      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "There are a terrible number of solar power sales persons who have little or no interest in the product they are selling.  In summary of my experience I approached 16 companies.  4 did not reply.  3 replied after the decision was made.  4 sent sales persons who did not have sufficient technical knowledge and came back with expensive quotes.  6 companies were adequately represented in a technical sense, but only 2 had the systems in which we were confident.We chose Pure Solar P/L because their representative (Phil) knew his business, constructively offered a number of configurations, took the time to back to answer further questions and was happy for us to take our time in making our decision. Pure Solar were not the largest competitor, nor were they the cheapest.We were so impressed that we extended the installation to also include a 315 litre solar hot water system.",
