      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "This industry really needs to clean up its act, there are so many little things, pitfalls, and bullshit.The Recs System sucks for the residential buyer, the market variability almost killed the deal.Trying to find ligitimate independent reviews of panel brands is a monumental challenge. Google searches only list company marketing and everybody has the best and produces the best.Every brand seems to have their own graph.PureSolar not only seemed to be the most straight forward, they seem to be more than a website and I am very confident the outcome will be great.  If it is crap I will write another review.",
